{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52185","headline":"颂六十二首 十 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韫石谅非真，饰瓶信爲假。\n宠（一作「窃」）服高（一作「臯」）门上，滥吹缁轩下。\n风（一作「凤」）祀结惊心，驺文终好野。\n真相岂或（一作「式」）昭，浮荣未能舍。\n迹殊冠冕客，事袭驱驰者。\n已矣歇郑声，天然乱周雅。\n富贵空争名，宠辱虚相駡。\n须臾风火烛，幻泡何足把。\n（见同书同卷《富贵部》。\n注一作者，爲《法苑珠林》卷七十之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}